ons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>100 Defeats? No Problem, Tomorrow, We Go Again</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">输了一百次不算，明日接着再战</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\"></td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">輸了一百次不算，明日接著再戰</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\"></span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">百回敗けたって</span> <span lang=\"ja\">明日も来るから</span><br /><small><i>Hyakkai Maketa tte Ashita wa Kuru kara</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">백</span> <span lang=\"ko\">번</span> <span lang=\"ko\">져도</span> <span lang=\"ko\">계속</span> <span lang=\"ko\">도전</span><br /><small><i>Baek Beon Jyeodo Gyesok Dojeon</i></small></td><td>Keep On Challenging Even After Losing a Hundred Times</td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Cien derrotas no importan, ma<span lang=\"es\">ñ</span>ana lucharemos otra vez</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Cent d<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>faites ne posent pas probl<span lang=\"fr\">è</span>me, demain est un jour nouveau</td><td>One Hundred Defeats Are Not a Problem, Tomorrow Is a New Day</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Сто</span> <span lang=\"ru\">поражений</span> <span lang=\"ru\">не</span> <span lang=\"ru\">в</span> <span lang=\"ru\">счёт</span>, <span lang=\"ru\">завтра</span> <span lang=\"ru\">продолжим</span> <span lang=\"ru\">бой</span><br /><small><i>Sto porazheniy ne v schyot, zavtra prodolzhim boy</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>100 Defeats? No Problem, Tomorrow, We Go Again</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietn